# AI platform destinations not covered by ACL4SSR AI.list.
# Referenced from config/Home_Routing_v2.ini, placed before YouTube.list.
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX matches each named domain and its subdomains.
# googleapis.com must stay ahead of ProxyLite.list, which also lists it.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,challenges.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stripe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com
